nd S\n\nFrom equation (3):  \n$$\nS = M + 23\n$$\n$$\nS = 73 + 23 = 96\n$$\n\nSo, **Summer has 96 cookies**.\n\n---\n\n### Step 5: Add up all the cookies\n\nNow we have:\n\n- Katarina: 68  \n- Max: 73  \n- Cookie Monster: 61  \n- Summer: 96  \n\nTotal =  \n$$\n68 + 73 + 61 + 96 = \\boxed{298}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n$$\n\\boxed{298}\n$$", "decode_seconds": 2.687217795755714, "draft_calls": 73, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 81, "mapper_checkpoint_sha256": "ece1269540becf19b73b75b0ca48a5dfd6178ffe372c6606870efbbab8ae580a", "method": "relay_base", "output_hash": "694ff5bbbe59d3473601d6ab36933c9a96485f0a4dd4a66686e9edaae3316129", "output_tokens": 552, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 23496431616, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 23752343552, "problem_id": "gsm8k/04c9fdeb308af985", "profile_regions_ms": {"draft": 458.1724781990051, "prefill_full_target": 32.44249725341797, "prefill_relay": 0.32022398710250854, "relay": 23.95427206158638, "unattributed_runtime": 26.466206926852465, "verification_full_target": 2180.4588203430176}, "proposal_lengths": [15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15], "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "298", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 2.721814498770982, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 23752343552, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 23752343552, "target_calls": 73, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.03280464792624116, "turn_index": 0}
